              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *chālā*, once more]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "nae jūtoṁ se mere pair meṁ chālā paṛ gayā. — My new shoes gave me a blister on my foot.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *nae jūtoṁ se mere pair meṁ chālā paṛ gayā.* — My new shoes gave me a blister on my foot.]"
