              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "कुरेदना (kurednā) is a tadbhava: CDIAL lists Hindi kurednā, \"to scrape\", under kura, a form it reconstructs (CDIAL 3319). One can also kurednā an old memory: stir it up again."
